{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a baseline multimodal setup using PCA-encoded RNA data, ResNet50-encoded images, and concatenation fusion without aggregation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest the multimodal approach achieves moderate performance, though no direct comparison to single-modality baselines is provided. The effectiveness of concatenation fusion versus alternative methods remains uncertain without additional comparative experiments."
}

